   rule 1/3     : within the limit of 10
   rule 2       : feeds 6 satellite(s) WHOLE. No satellite in this build is split
                  across views; the plan asserts that by re-counting homes.
   rules 5/6    : 18 hub key(s) resolve on this view, so its hubs and its 0 link(s)
                  are derived FROM here and not from anywhere else.
   satellites   : SAT_COMMON_COMMUNICATION_PREFERENCE, SAT_COVERAGE_SUBLIMIT_SCHEDULE, SAT_LNK_POLICY_PARTY_ROLE, SAT_PARTY_DIGITAL_IDENTITY, SAT_PARTY_ORGANISATION_PROFILE, SAT_PROPOSAL_HEADER
   links        : (none)
   join type    : FULL OUTER. An inner join would silently drop a key present on one
